text-ink">저승사자의 명부 사주</h2><p class="text-sm leading-[1.55] text-ink/80 break-keep">“명부에 네 이름이 아직 없더라. 이름부터 알려줘.”</p><span class="mt-1.5 h-[52px] rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-base font-bold flex items-center justify-center">명부 열어 보기</span></span></a><a data-hero-slide="true" data-index="1" class="relative flex-none w-full h-[500px] snap-center block overflow-hidden" style="background:#1E1838" href="/face-match"><img src="/images/cast/gumiho.webp" alt="구미호 캐릭터" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_20%]"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[270px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-paper/85 to-paper"></span><span class="absolute left-5 right-5 bottom-[22px] flex flex-col gap-2.5"><span class="self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime text-paper text-xs font-bold">궁합</span><h2 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.25] font-extrabold tracking-tight break-keep text-ink">인연의 실, 얼굴 궁합</h2><p class="text-sm leading-[1.55] text-ink/80 break-keep">“두 사람 사이에 인연의 실이 얼마나 단단한지 볼까?”</p><span class="mt-1.5 h-[52px] rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-base font-bold flex items-center justify-center">실 당겨 보기</span></span></a><a data-hero-slide="true" data-index="2" class="relative flex-none w-full h-[500px] snap-center block overflow-hidden" style="background:#2A2116" href="/face2"><img src="/images/cast/haetae.webp" alt="해태 캐릭터" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_20%]"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[270px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-paper/85 to-paper"></span><span class="absolute left-5 right-5 bottom-[22px] flex flex-col gap-2.5"><span class="self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime text-paper text-xs font-bold">관상</span><h2 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.25] font-extrabold tracking-tight break-keep text-ink">얼굴을 있는 그대로 봐요</h2><p class="text-sm leading-[1.55] text-ink/80 break-keep">“얼굴을 있는 그대로 볼게요. 정면 사진 한 장이면 돼요.”</p><span class="mt-1.5 h-[52px] rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-base font-bold flex items-center justify-center">내 관상 보러 가기</span></span></a><a data-hero-slide="true" data-index="3" class="relative flex-none w-full h-[500px] snap-center block overflow-hidden" style="background:#1B2436" href="/animal"><img src="/images/cast/tiger.webp" alt="백호 캐릭터" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_20%]"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[270px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-paper/85 to-paper"></span><span class="absolute left-5 right-5 bottom-[22px] flex flex-col gap-2.5"><span class="self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime text-paper text-xs font-bold">동물상</span><h2 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.25] font-extrabold tracking-tight break-keep text-ink">너는 어느 숲의 무리야?</h2><p class="text-sm leading-[1.55] text-ink/80 break-keep">“네 얼굴은 어느 숲의 무리일까? 사진 한 장 보여 줘.”</p><span class="mt-1.5 h-[52px] rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-base font-bold flex items-center justify-center">무리 찾아보기</span></span></a><a data-hero-slide="true" data-index="4" class="relative flex-none w-full h-[500px] snap-center block overflow-hidden" style="background:#10261F" href="/exam/meme"><img src="/images/cast/dokkaebi.webp" alt="도깨비 캐릭터" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_20%]"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[270px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-paper/85 to-paper"></span><span class="absolute left-5 right-5 bottom-[22px] flex flex-col gap-2.5"><span class="self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime text-paper text-xs font-bold">밈 능력고사</span><h2 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.25] font-extrabold tracking-tight break-keep text-ink">내기 하나 할래? 5문제</h2><p class="text-sm leading-[1.55] text-ink/80 break-keep">“내기 하나 할래? 5문제, 시간 안에 맞히면 돼.”</p><span class="mt-1.5 h-[52px] rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-base font-bold flex items-center justify-center">내기 시작</span></span></a><a data-hero-slide="true" data-index="5" class="relative flex-none w-full h-[500px] snap-center block overflow-hidden" style="background:#2A1418" href="/bujeok"><img src="/images/cast/mudang.webp" alt="무당 캐릭터" width="720" height="960" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_20%]"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-[270px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-paper/85 to-paper"></span><span class="absolute left-5 right-5 bottom-[22px] flex flex-col gap-2.5"><span class="self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-lime text-paper text-xs font-bold">부적</span><h2 class="font-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.25] font-extrabold tracking-tight break-keep text-ink">어떤 마음을 담아 드릴까요?</h2><p class="text-sm leading-[1.55] text-ink/80 break-keep">“고른 소원을 방울 소리에 실어 둘게요.”</p><span class="mt-1.5 h-[52px] rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-base font-bold flex items-center justify-center">부적 만들기</span></span></a></div><span data-hero-count="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute top-3.5 left-3.5 px-3 py-[5px] rounded-full bg-paper/70 border border-line text-xs text-ink">1 / 6</span></div><div class="flex justify-center gap-1.5 pt-3" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1.5 rounded-[3px] transition-all w-[18px] bg-ink"></span><span class="h-1.5 rounded-[3px] transition-all w-1.5 bg-line"></span><span class="h-1.5 rounded-[3px] transition-all w-1.5 bg-line"></span><span class="h-1.5 rounded-[3px] transition-all w-1.5 bg-line"></span><span class="h-1.5 rounded-[3px] transition-all w-1.5 bg-line"></span><span class="h-1.5 rounded-[3px] transition-all w-1.5 bg-line"></span></div></div></section><h2 class="font-serif font-extrabold text-[19px] tracking-tight